      "message": "I feel like define a `RETURN_IF(condition, retCode, message)` seems more consistency, so this will be:\n```\nRETURN_IF(mModule \u003d\u003d nullptr, NO_INIT, \"module not initialized\");\nRETURN_IF(state \u003d\u003d nullptr, BAD_VALUE, \"uninitialized mute state\");\n```",
